1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:03,000
Trigoku today. Isla checks what sort of trouble it is first.

2
00:00:03,000 --> 00:00:06,000
She is at small kitchen table in warm morning light, already half-thinking about the next job.

3
00:00:06,000 --> 00:00:09,000
Then the day starts tugging at her sleeve again.

4
00:00:09,000 --> 00:00:12,000
She leaves one message unread. Three minutes will not ruin anything.

5
00:00:12,000 --> 00:00:15,000
Today has its own little rule-set — check the constraint before rushing.

6
00:00:15,000 --> 00:00:18,000
The move holds, which is annoyingly satisfying.

7
00:00:18,000 --> 00:00:21,000
She shuts the laptop before the rush gets the last word.

8
00:00:21,000 --> 00:00:24,000
